    why: 'This has practical applications beyond mysticism: the things we are genuinely drawn to — the problems that fascinate, the people who move us, the questions that won\'t leave us alone — are often indicators of where our deepest capacities lie. Attention follows something before the conscious mind articulates why. Learning to trust that pull is a skill.',
